# Plugin folders of this repo that scripts/install.sh installs first.
# The layout's status bar draws spotlight's footer; without it, its block
# shows "<mod> did not load". claude-accounts brings its CLI and launcher
# (Collie shows the accounts; no layout draws the usage since local-39).
claude-accounts
spotlight
# The status bar's last cell, the moon, runs the agent-sleep plugin's loop. It
# stays off until turned on in the popup the moon opens.
agent-sleep
# The right panel draws code-editor's Explorer, the layout wears its One Dark
# Pro theme, and its keys.json brings cmd-l, which opens and closes the panel.
code-editor
# The status bar's cup, right before the moon, runs keep-awake's loop: it keeps
# the Mac awake (always, or while an agent works). It starts off.
keep-awake
